# party.pdl - the roster of the rpg-edit-hq island board, read by ops/rpg_edit.+x at start (house shape: one game's own party.pdl is its roster, see 16.game/BET-RPG-DESIGN.md).
# PET | name | art id | letter | red | green | blue | spawn x | spawn y
#   art id : art/<art id>.csv (a pals sprite.csv copy, 64x64); missing = the pet is a coloured block
#   letter : one character for the map legend; colour: the fallback block colour (the art's average replaces it)
#   spawn  : the cell on the main island where it starts (island F, in front of the cabin)
# Up to 16 pets. Add a row, restart the daemon, nothing else changes.
